        "original_id": "c073e19f-c759-571e-a555-c5df1b73a8a9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Kaiyuan, Liaoning; Yanzhou District; Jilin; Jining; Shandong; Liaoning; China\n- People: Du Zheheng\n\nFacts:\n- Kaiyuan is a county-level city in northeastern Liaoning, People's Republic of China.\n- Kaiyuan borders Jilin along a small section to the north.\n- Yanzhou, also known by the postal name Yenchow, is a district under the administration of Jining in southwestern Shandong, People's Republic of China.\n- Yanzhou was formerly a county-level city.\n- Du Zheheng was born in Kaiyuan, Liaoning.",
